WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.840
You've taken the first step, and most important step, you showed up.

00:04.840 --> 00:07.120
You've entered the arena.

00:07.120 --> 00:10.920
The path ahead will be challenging.

00:10.920 --> 00:14.280
It will also be profoundly rewarding.

00:14.280 --> 00:18.920
Commit the time in advance on your calendar each and every week.

00:18.920 --> 00:25.440
The power to architect a career and life of extraordinary impact is not just a dream,

00:25.440 --> 00:35.720
it's a capacity you can build, refine, and master.

00:35.720 --> 00:41.520
In our next lesson, we begin our preseason conditioning, where you'll start the deep

00:41.520 --> 00:47.680
work of crafting your inner blueprint, the foundation of your leadership and your life.

00:47.680 --> 00:52.360
I am genuinely thrilled and honored to be your coach on this journey.

00:52.440 --> 00:55.760
I see the champion you are ready to unleash within.

00:55.760 --> 00:57.240
You've got this.

00:57.240 --> 00:59.320
Now make it happen.

00:59.320 --> 01:02.790
When you're ready, head to your playbook to complete your first drill.

01:03.310 --> 01:05.470
You're building the foundation.

01:05.470 --> 01:06.470
Keep going.
